  "title": "ISic001556. Epitaph of Iason and Theudora",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰάσων Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰάσων\"><span data-text=\"Ἰάσων\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἰάσων\">Ἰάσων</span></span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Ἀρτάφαν\">Ἀρταφᾶντος</span></span></span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτω\n                    ς\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ἀμέμπτω-<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ς</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ἕτη</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.2)</span>  <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ο\">ο</span>´ <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Θευδώρα\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Θευδώρα\"><span data-text=\"Θευδώρα\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδώρα\">Θευδώρα</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτω\n                    ς\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ἀμέμπτω-<br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ς</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ἕτη</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ξ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ζ\">ξ</span>´ </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Dmitry Dundua, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Ἰάσων\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἰάσων\">Ἰάσων</span>  <span data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Ἀρτάφαν\">Ἀρταφᾶντος</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτως\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ἀμέμπτως</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ἕτη</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.2)</span>  <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ο\">ο</span>  <span data-text=\"Θευδώρα\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδώρα\">Θευδώρα</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτως\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ἀμέμπτως</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ἕτη</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\">(vac.1)</span>  <span data-text=\"ζ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ζ\">ζ</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰάσων Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰάσων\"><span data-text=\"Ἰάσων\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἰάσων\">ΙΑΣΩΝ</span></span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\"><span data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Ἀρτάφαν\">ΑΡΤΑΦΑΝΤΟΣ</span></span></span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτω\n                    ς\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ΑΜΕΜΠΤΩ<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>Σ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ΕΤΗ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ο\">Ο</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Θευδώρα\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Θευδώρα\"><span data-text=\"Θευδώρα\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδώρα\">ΘΕΥΔΩΡΑ</span></span></span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτω\n                    ς\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ΑΜΕΜΠΤΩ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>Σ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ΕΤΗ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ξ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ζ\">Ξ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Dmitry Dundua, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Ἰάσων\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἰάσων\">ΙΑΣΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"Ἀρταφᾶντος\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Ἀρτάφαν\">ΑΡΤΑΦΑΝΤΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτως\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ΑΜΕΜΠΤΩΣ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ΕΤΗ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"ο\">Ο</span><span data-text=\"Θευδώρα\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδώρα\">ΘΕΥΔΩΡΑ</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἀμέμπτως\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ἄμεμπτος\">ΑΜΕΜΠΤΩΣ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ἕτη\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ἕτος\">ΕΤΗ</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"ζ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ζ\">Ζ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic001556_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic001556_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic001556.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic001556-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><p>  </p><p>Text of IGPalermo checked against photograph</p>  <p></p></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>Iason son of Artaphan lived blamelessly for 70 years; Theudora lived blamelessly for 60 years.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The stone is distinctive for the effort put into making the descriptions of age on lines 3 and 6 symmetrical, by using the final sigma of the preceding word on the line above to balance the numeral in each case. The name Jason is a common Hebrew one.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 26.1077 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> 1976.0058 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282</a>  </li><li></li><li> Manni Piraino 1973 26 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Elegantly carved rounded v-cut letters, with curving extensions to alpha; lunate epsilon and sigma, uncial omega; cursive mu.</p> Line 1-6  15-20  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
